---
import {site} from '../site.config';import '../styles/global.css';const{title,description=site.description}=Astro.props;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>{title} | 거실상영관</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={new URL(Astro.url.pathname,site.url).href}/><meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:image" content={site.url+'/og/home.png'}/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="google-adsense-account" content={site.adsenseClient}/>{site.gscVerification&&<meta name="google-site-verification" content={site.gscVerification}/>} {site.naverVerification&&<meta name="naver-site-verification" content={site.naverVerification}/>}<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Organization',name:site.name,url:site.url,description:site.description})}/></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로 이동</a><header><a class="brand" href="/">거실상영관<small>WHERE ON OTT / HOME CINEMA NOTES</small></a><nav><a href="/guides/">상영 준비</a><a href="/methodology/">편집 기준</a><a href="/about/">소개</a></nav></header><main id="main"><slot/></main><footer><strong>상영이 끝나도, 선택의 기준은 남도록.</strong><p>현재 가이드에는 제휴 링크가 없습니다. 제휴 글은 글 상단과 링크 옆에 수수료 관계를 표시합니다.</p><nav>{['about','methodology','contact','privacy','terms','disclaimer'].map((s,i)=><a href={'/'+s+'/'}>{['소개','방법론','문의','개인정보','약관','면책'][i]}</a>)}</nav></footer></body></html>
